        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A hot dog is a frankfurter in a bun. The technique is minimal: score the sausage and cook in a dry pan until the skin is blistered and beginning to char in places. This gives more flavour than poaching in water. Toast the bun in the same pan."
          }
        ]
      },
